cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite BOTH the software entry below and the
  associated manuscript listed under `references`.
title: "VR-FraudNet: reproducibility package for verifier-grounded fraud detection"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and reproducibility package for the five-stage
  verifier-grounded fraud-detection framework VR-FraudNet: a time-conditioned
  spectral graph encoder, a LightGBM triage and threshold router, a
  schema-constrained rationale language model, a fixed deterministic verifier,
  and an isotonic probability mixer with split-conformal calibration.
type: software
license: MIT
